


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_b32664ff:



    voice "2HI_0350"
    hina "「今天天气这么好，我们要不要去散散步？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_9d78aeb8:


    "阳菜在十字路红绿灯亮红灯的时候对圣夜子说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_5061c5c8:



    voice "2MI_0258"
    miyako "「不错啊。让我一起吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_88c240ef:



    voice "2RI_0327"
    rin "「诶～好冷的，我才不要」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_5bf9d084:



    voice "2HI_0351"
    hina "「又不是找你。伦你快点回去」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_e4bf9cd7:



    voice "2FU_0275"
    fumi "「我……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_994eac95:



    voice "2HI_0352"
    hina "「浅生可以把伦带回宿舍吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_1c142620:



    voice "2FU_0276"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_697966ce:



    voice "2RI_0328"
    rin "「等等，这会不会过分了点？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_7a1128c4:



    voice "2FU_0277"
    fumi "「我知道了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_9fcea893:



    voice "2RI_0329"
    rin "「呃，这就知道了？我可是被阳菜说了很过分的话哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_57b31e9d:



    voice "2FU_0278"
    fumi "「……伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_f867af06:


    "文轻轻地叹了一口气，然后扯着伦的袖子让她弯下身并对她说悄悄话。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c78b80fe:



    voice "2RI_0330"
    rin "「诶……啊……嗯……那我就回去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_9419fd2f:


    "伦拉高了声调。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_9bd67ade:



    voice "2HI_0353"
    hina "「我和鹰冈同学会在外面转悠两个小时左右……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_9d6b989c:


    "阳菜使了个眼色，圣夜子也点头示意。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_a845fbfd:



    voice "2FU_0279"
    fumi "「我明白了。那我们回去吧，伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_b3634367:



    voice "2RI_0331"
    rin "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_856562a6:



    voice "2MI_0259"
    miyako "「那么，待会儿见」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_348d13b2:


    "文和圣夜子彼此向对方挥手告别。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_6710fc31:



    voice "2HI_0354"
    hina "「抱歉啊，我擅自做了决定」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_86efcfe4:


    "目送两人离去的阳菜转向圣夜子，轻轻点了一下头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c1d204db:



    voice "2HI_0355"
    hina "「站着说话应该会很冷吧？如果说有哪间咖啡厅开着就好了，毕竟还在元旦期间」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_be8eec67:


    "顺带一提这里是一座没有星巴克的城镇。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_8f528c08:



    voice "2MI_0260"
    miyako "「啊，我并不怎么怕冷的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c200ef05:



    voice "2HI_0356"
    hina "「这样吗？其实我也是的。那我们一边走一边聊吧。带你去逛逛这个小镇」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_6207b018:


    "风之子们出发了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_7ff99a15:



    voice "2HI_0357"
    hina "「估计鹰冈同学也已经猜到了，她们俩其实是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c254f219:



    voice "2MI_0261"
    miyako "「很要好，对吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_4ff99f9b:


    "圣夜子露出意味深长的微笑。阳菜也察觉到圣夜子其实已经看穿了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_fa343448:



    voice "2HI_0358"
    hina "「嗯，然后呢。我就想多让伦和浅生有两人独处的时间」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_e83db10e:



    voice "2MI_0262"
    miyako "「是的，这点我赞成」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_eca01e4a:



    voice "2HI_0359"
    hina "「啊哈。所以，能稍微陪我一下吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_4f305eb5:



    voice "2MI_0263"
    miyako "「我很乐意」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_e41efe14:



    voice "2HI_0360"
    hina "「好了。虽然说是要带你去走走，不过店铺基本都关门休息了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_0c17c056:


    "像这种郊外的小镇的店铺在元旦期间开店的话基本没有什么赚头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_51387df2:



    voice "2MI_0264"
    miyako "「不过，我很高兴能和你像这样轻松地对话呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_41e46182:



    voice "2HI_0361"
    hina "「我才该那样说……鹰冈同学你人真好啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_d0d04bb0:



    voice "2MI_0265"
    miyako "「是那样吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_f7c9d2f1:



    voice "2HI_0362"
    hina "「明明你才来没多久，该不会让你太费心了吧？各种方面的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_395a4171:



    voice "2MI_0266"
    miyako "「没关系的。看着两人如此要好我就很开心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_3fdb9a71:



    voice "2HI_0363"
    hina "「嗯，我也是那么认为的。只不过，你看，毕竟是这个年纪的女生」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_93800900:


    "阳菜话中有话。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_437fdceb:



    voice "2MI_0267"
    miyako "「啊，确实是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_1afe3dc8:


    "圣夜子也明白了言外之意。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_8f25bdd3:



    voice "2HI_0364"
    hina "「作为室长我倒是想维护宿舍的风纪——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_bf4f11d1:



    voice "2MI_0268"
    miyako "「然后又不想管得太紧对吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_32bbe50b:



    voice "2HI_0365"
    hina "「就是那么一回事。抱歉啊，说不定以后我得时不时找你商谈了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_3da5423a:



    voice "2MI_0269"
    miyako "「好的。请不用客气」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_8e5ec94b:



    voice "2HI_0366"
    hina "「毕竟怎么说也太尴尬了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_2accbdc4:



    voice "2MI_0270"
    miyako "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_5340e33c:



    voice "2HI_0367"
    hina "「啊，之前有一次，偶然地在她们俩亲热的时候撞了个准。在教堂做那样的事……谁会想到啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_cc2e873f:



    voice "2MI_0271"
    miyako "「啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_83b14a07:


    "没法开口说“那个我也看到了”。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_ed31744c:



    voice "2HI_0368"
    hina "「不过，从那以后她们就开始公然放闪了呢。简直就像是钢箍被拆掉了一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_7711b203:



    voice "2HI_0369"
    hina "「在我面前的话就算了，在鹰冈同学面前也是这样。浅生的话呢，还算比较拘谨的，然而伦就整天粘过去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_0701e92c:



    voice "2MI_0272"
    miyako "「这倒是不用在意我的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_629c9bb0:



    voice "2HI_0370"
    hina "「只是黏在一起亲热的话，我也还是不太介意的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_349f34c9:



    voice "2HI_0371"
    hina "「是该说伦太过依赖浅生了吗。不过虽说老早前就已经是那模样，但还是有点看不下去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_986a00a9:



    voice "2HI_0372"
    hina "「浅生她也是，因为太过温柔了所以很宠伦。虽说我这可能有点杞人忧天了，但还是有点担心啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_98da1efd:



    voice "2HI_0373"
    hina "「……不过多少还是能理解的。毕竟伦小时候双亲似乎常年不在家所以就没怎么撒过娇嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_801ce491:



    voice "2MI_0273"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_45fcdafa:



    voice "2HI_0374"
    hina "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_eeb34389:



    voice "2MI_0274"
    miyako "「感觉夏目同学真的非常重视她们两个呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_19203379:



    voice "2HI_0375"
    hina "「啊、嗯，算是吧……毕竟是非常重要的挚友嘛。所以我希望今后一直都能和睦相处」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_ecfc8d1a:



    voice "2MI_0275"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_b7ba0776:


    "竟然能够如此坦率地说出「挚友」这个如此有份量的词。这个女孩果然很厉害。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_2f4df472:



    voice "2HI_0376"
    hina "「啊，抱歉，可以等一等吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_b8547674:


    "阳菜突然停下了脚步。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c6646453:



    voice "2MI_0276"
    miyako "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_25c66274:


    "然后从袋子里取出个小小的箱子。是那个玩具相机。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_7b5d926e:



    voice "2HI_0377"
    hina "「我想拍一张这里的照片。因为色彩真的很丰富啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_e2a694e5:


    "有一间仍在营业的小小玩具店，在元旦期间整条街的店铺几乎都休业的情况下，显得格外醒目。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_ce678665:



    voice "2MI_0277"
    miyako "「真的呢。明明其他店都已经关门了，只有这里是特别鲜艳的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_3abffcf3:


    "回过头来的圣夜子双眼闪闪发光。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_25993c39:


    "阳菜则是摆出各种姿势来按下相机的快门。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_aaeac975:



    voice "2HI_0378"
    hina "「那个布偶，会不会是浅生所收藏的系列中的新作品呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_60c73e08:


    "店门口前放着货架车，而上面陈列着的是似曾相识的布偶。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c5be9fa9:



    voice "2MI_0278"
    miyako "「说起来还真的挺像呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_358746da:


    "圣夜子捧起了一个布偶。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_53fb3407:



    voice "2HI_0379"
    hina "「鹰冈同学，看这边！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_298a41d6:



    voice "2MI_0279"
    miyako "「！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_691c6c74:


    "圣夜子面向相机后，露出了吃惊的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_68c51252:



    voice "2HI_0380"
    hina "「啊，抱歉。你不喜欢拍照吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c622c1d1:



    voice "2MI_0280"
    miyako "「不、不是……只不过是稍微吓了一下而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_6005e6e2:


    "估计是还保留着天使的习惯吧。明明已经可以拍了的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_2c84d227:



    voice "2HI_0381"
    hina "「那，我可以再拍一张吗？这次笑一下♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_a6a03684:



    voice "2MI_0281"
    miyako "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_6ab317c9:


    "这次就露出了微笑。尽管笑容有点僵硬。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_00ce8a20:



    voice "2HI_0382"
    hina "「谢谢。下次冲洗好了就拿给你看哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_a008a95d:



    voice "2MI_0282"
    miyako "「话说，那台相机，能不能让我看一看呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_7cd6c743:



    voice "2HI_0383"
    hina "「嗯，可以啊。虽然只是普通的玩具相机」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_fa15d2e8:


    "圣夜子接过了相机。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_637d58c5:



    voice "2MI_0283"
    miyako "「这就是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_2491d2e2:


    "然后一边摆弄着相机一边从各种角度来观察。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_90ff099c:



    voice "2HI_0384"
    hina "「怎么了？是第一次见玩具相机吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_e38cd6fe:



    voice "2MI_0284"
    miyako "「没有什么特别的地方呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_6dcec7b9:



    voice "2HI_0385"
    hina "「嗯，所以我才说是普通的玩具相机嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_80dc498a:



    voice "2MI_0285"
    miyako "「真是不可思议……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_cc685273:



    voice "2HI_0386"
    hina "「鹰冈同学你也是呀……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_214afa77:



    voice "2HI_0387"
    hina "「话说，鹰冈同学你……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_4cec0653:



    voice "2MI_0286"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_b8e429cc:


    "圣夜子仍然热衷于检视着这台相机。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_c223dc92:



    voice "2HI_0388"
    hina "「……应该相信的吧，天使？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_66187a21:



    voice "2MI_0288"
    miyako "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_b06aa02a:


    "圣夜子停下了摆弄相机的手，并抬起了头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_6e1a138c:



    voice "2HI_0389"
    hina "「那个……呃……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_48e44373:


    "阳菜不知如何开口。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_7a3d8218:



    voice "2MI_0287"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_44732cc4:


    "圣夜子则平静地等待阳菜整理话语。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_e0e8a7fc:



    voice "2HI_0390"
    hina "「我……用那台相机拍下了天使」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_59fa1d93:



    voice "2MI_0289"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_d4aca1e7:



    voice "2HI_0391"
    hina "「在很久以前。我很小的时候。那台相机是我的圣诞礼物——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_99c3ed6b:


    "阳菜开始滔滔不绝地叙说起来。在平安夜里拍到了拈起了蛋糕上的草莓并吃掉的天使。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_8b2fc99a:


    "尽管阳菜没能整理好话语的顺序，但字里行间都充满了她的热情。圣夜子也侧耳倾听着这一切。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_0fd4d656_1:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_8a322173:



    voice "2HI_0392"
    hina "「抱歉啊……突然间跟你说了些奇怪的话」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_01cc9f7e:


    "圣夜子只是稍微摇了摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_a8eabab9:



    voice "2HI_0393"
    hina "「因为总感觉鹰冈同学似乎能接受这些的，不经意就——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_0f51e1fe:



    voice "2MI_0290"
    miyako "「既然是夏目同学说的话，我肯定是相信的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_96194982:


    "圣夜子露出了坚定的眼神以表示肯定。也对，毕竟她知道那天使的真正身份是什么。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_105dacab:



    voice "2HI_0394"
    hina "「这件事我一直都瞒着大家的……但还是很想说出来」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_1a895e50:



    voice "2MI_0291"
    miyako "「很高兴你能告诉我这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_9f1c5af5:



    voice "2HI_0395"
    hina "「谢谢你啊。能和鹰冈同学说出来真是太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_345b1148:


    "看见圣夜子像理所当然般地接受这件事后阳菜的表情也变得开朗起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_d0234347:



    voice "2HI_0396"
    hina "「等回去之后……我把天使的照片，拿给你看哦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_dfe5ed54:



    voice "2MI_0292"
    miyako "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_4a03bceb:


    "阳菜迈起了步子，而圣夜子则还是站在那，她感到非常开心。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_ed8de942:


    "她知道阳菜时不时就会悄悄地翻开相集，也从阳菜的背后偷偷瞄过那张照片。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_f739f368:


    "不过那当然是圣夜子以天使的身份窥视着这个房间时的事了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_2205d33e:


    "最重要的并不是阳菜所说的或是所拍下的作为证据的照片，而是阳菜向自己坦白了非常重要的秘密。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_2893bfca:



    voice "2HI_0397"
    hina "「鹰冈同学——？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_bb49820f:



    voice "2MI_0293"
    miyako "「好，我马上来」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_33d3698e:


    "圣夜子应答着然后向着阳菜走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_d42e6e55:



    voice "2MI_0294"
    miyako "「天使……是存在的呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_ac107a65:


    "突然间相机的镜头对准了我这边的天空。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou3_02_a0085c66:


    "——哎呦。"
